OL,3,GNEWSAHealth secretary denies cover-up  
OL,4,Aover NHS Grampian issues               
OL,6,FThe health secretary has denied a      
OL,7,Fcover-up surrounding an unreleased     
OL,8,Freport showing that 19 deaths at a     
OL,9,Fhealth board could have been avoided.  
OL,11,FAngela Constance said she was "not     
OL,12,Fsatisfied that all questions have been 
OL,13,Fasked or answered" about how concerns  
OL,14,Fover hepatobiliary care at NHS Grampian
OL,15,Fwere handled.                          
OL,17,FIt comes after Dr Mohammed Habib       
OL,18,Fclaimed he had contacted the Scottish  
OL,19,Fgovernment on four separate occasions  
OL,20,Fand gone to the police and the lord    
OL,21,Fadvocate to raise issues over patient  
OL,22,Fsafety.                                
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
