OL,3,GNEWSAHealth secretary denies cover-up  
OL,4,Aover NHS Grampian issues               
OL,6,FConstance has ordered an independent   
OL,7,Freview into hepatobiliary surgery at   
OL,8,Fthe board, saying she wants "100%      
OL,9,Ftransparency" for the sake of patients 
OL,10,Fand staff in order to ensure public    
OL,11,Fconfidence.                            
